## Variable Substitution

Variables can be used in configurations using the `{variable}` syntax:

### Context Variables
- `{context.tenantId}` - Current tenant ID
- `{context.userId}` - Current user ID
- `{context.userRole}` - Current user role
- `{context.timezone}` - User's timezone

### Filter Variables
- `{filter.startDate}` - Selected start date
- `{filter.endDate}` - Selected end date
- `{filter.dateRange}` - Selected date range preset
- `{filter.[filterName]}` - Any custom filter value

### Environment Variables
- `{env.API_KEY}` - Environment variables
- `{env.BASE_URL}` - Base URL configuration

### System Variables
- `{system.currentDate}` - Current date
- `{system.currentTime}` - Current time
- `{system.timestamp}` - Current timestamp

### Widget Variables
- `{widget.value}` - Current widget value
- `{widget.selection}` - Selected items in widget

